{"product_id":"youre-a-bad-man-mr-gum","title":"You're a bad man, Mr Gum!","description":"\u003cp\u003eMr Gum is a complete horror who hates children, animals, fun and corn on the cob. This book's all about him. And an angry fairy who lives in his bathtub. And Jake the dog, and a little girl called Polly and an evil, stinky butcher all covered in guts. And there's heroes and sweets and adventures and everything. You're a Bad Man, Mr Gum! is the first book in the internationally best-selling series by Andy Stanton, which has won everything from the Blue Peter Book Award (twice) the Roald Dahl Funny Prize and the Red House Children's Book Award. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Andy Stanton \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781405274920 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 159\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44970742579353,"sku":"17RB-4-9781405274920","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/4402555ce675023b4b2ac8b365f81d83.jpg?v=1732122271","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/youre-a-bad-man-mr-gum","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}